<h1 data-copy-en="Helsa" data-copy-zh="Helsa">Helsa</h1>
<p class="starter-description" data-copy-en="Unlock Helsa, follow the alternating research schedule, and coordinate her dates and conversations with Torea’s route." data-copy-zh="解锁Helsa，掌握单双日研究行程，并与Torea路线衔接约会和交心。">Unlock Helsa, follow the alternating research schedule, and coordinate her dates and conversations with Torea’s route.</p>
<div class="wiki-source-line"><span data-copy-en="v1.0_BETAx · Updated 9 November 2026" data-copy-zh="v1.0_BETAx · 2026 年 11 月 9 日更新">v1.0_BETAx · Updated 9 November 2026</span></div></div></section>
<section class="section wiki-reading-section"><div class="container wiki-reading-layout">
<aside class="wiki-toc"><div class="wiki-toc-inner"><button aria-expanded="false" class="wiki-toc-toggle" data-wiki-toc-toggle="" type="button"><span data-copy-en="On this page" data-copy-zh="本页目录">On this page</span><span aria-hidden="true">+</span></button><p class="wiki-toc-heading" data-copy-en="On this page" data-copy-zh="本页目录">On this page</p><div class="wiki-toc-links" data-lang-panel="en" data-wiki-toc-links=""><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#en-overview">Overview</a><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#en-location">Where to find them</a><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#en-route">Route and relationship milestones</a><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#en-activities">Activities and rewards</a><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#en-troubleshooting">What usually blocks the next step</a><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#en-related">Related guides</a></div><div class="wiki-toc-links" data-lang-panel="zh" data-wiki-toc-links="" hidden="" lang="zh-CN"><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#zh-overview">概览</a><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#zh-location">去哪里找</a><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#zh-route">路线与关系进展</a><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#zh-activities">行动与奖励</a><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#zh-troubleshooting">卡住时检查什么</a><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#zh-related">相关指南</a></div></div></aside>
<article class="wiki-article"><div class="wiki-source-content wiki-source-content-en" data-lang-panel="en" lang="en"><section id="en-overview"><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Best_Automatic_Scene_Bonuses"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Automatic_Scene_Requirements"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="No_Weapon_Between_Us"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="The_Long_Pursuit"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="The_Hunter_I_Chose"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Best_Heart-to-Heart_Answers"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Heart-to-Heart_Requirements"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Dates"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Talk_and_Relationship_Rewards"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Recommended_Relationship_Walkthrough"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Unlocking_Helsa"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Quick_Stats"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Overview"></span><h2>Overview</h2><figure class="reviewed-screenshot" style="max-width: 256px"><a aria-label="View full screenshot: Helsa — character portrait." href="../assets/images/wiki/profiles/helsa.webp" rel="noopener" target="_blank"><img alt="Helsa — character portrait." decoding="async" height="175" loading="lazy" src="../assets/images/wiki/profiles/helsa.webp" width="175"/></a><figcaption>Helsa — character portrait.</figcaption></figure><p>Helsa’s investigation crosses Torea’s route. Her current content includes six personal scenes, two personal dates, three ordered heart-to-hearts and shared encounters. This guide leaves her background and the hunt’s outcomes undisclosed.</p></section>
<section id="en-location"><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Regular_Schedule"></span><h2>Where to find them</h2><p>First complete The Scent of Silver, then visit Back Alley01:00–04:00 for The Hunt Arrives. This introduction has a different window from her later patrol.</p><p>Afterwards: University Hall odd days 09:00–13:00; City Library (Uptown) even days 10:00–14:00; downtown alley daily 20:00–24:00. After A Hunter Bleeds, Residential Block06:00–09:00 also opens.</p></section>
<section id="en-route"><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Current_Route_Boundaries"></span><h2>Route and relationship milestones</h2><p>Follow the university scene → Comic Con date at Friend 100 → first library heart-to-heart → her library scene. Continue Torea’s linked route before returning for the later alley scene, second heart-to-heart and stargazing.</p><table><thead><tr><th scope="col">Automatic scene</th><th scope="col">Location / start window</th><th scope="col">Requirements</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><th scope="row">The Hunt Arrives</th><td data-label="Location / start window">Back Alley; 01:00–03:59</td><td data-label="Requirements">after The Scent of Silver</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">A Student of Monsters</th><td data-label="Location / start window">University Hall; odd days, 09:00–12:59</td><td data-label="Requirements">Acknowledged (10); after The Hunt Arrives</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Helsa’s library scene</th><td data-label="Location / start window">City Library (Uptown); even days, 10:00–13:59</td><td data-label="Requirements">Friend (100); after Comic Con with Helsa / The Hunter I Chose</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">A Hunter Bleeds</th><td data-label="Location / start window">Back Alley; 21:00–23:59</td><td data-label="Requirements">after Loose the Cat</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">The Arrow She Does Not Loose</th><td data-label="Location / start window">Back Alley; 21:00–23:59</td><td data-label="Requirements">Close Friend (200); after Stargazing with Helsa / Teeth With Ribbons / The Long Pursuit</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">The Hunter Who Returns</th><td data-label="Location / start window">Residential Block; 06:00–08:59</td><td data-label="Requirements">Romantic (800); after Five Minutes of Night / No Weapon Between Us</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Loose the Cat</th><td data-label="Location / start window">Torea's Chamber; 19:00–21:59</td><td data-label="Requirements">Torea Friend (100); Friend (100); after Fair Date with Torea / Helsa’s library scene / The Shape of Appetite / The Hunter I Chose</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Blood Owed, Blood Chosen</th><td data-label="Location / start window">Torea's Chamber; 19:00–21:59</td><td data-label="Requirements">Torea Close Friend (200); after Boardwalk After Sunset / A Hunter Bleeds / A Larger Night; Becky currently available</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Five Minutes of Night</th><td data-label="Location / start window">Back Alley; 21:00–23:59</td><td data-label="Requirements">Torea Close Friend (200); Close Friend (200); after Blood Owed, Blood Chosen / The Arrow She Does Not Loose / A Larger Night / The Long Pursuit</td></tr></tbody></table><table><thead><tr><th scope="col">Action</th><th scope="col">Requirements / start window</th><th scope="col">Cost / recovery</th><th scope="col">Reward / limit</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><th scope="row">The Hunter I Chose</th><td data-label="Requirements / start window">City Library (Uptown); Friend (100); after Comic Con with Helsa; even days, 10:00–12:59</td><td data-label="Cost / recovery">75 min; 15 Energy; restores 5 Calm</td><td data-label="Reward / limit">once</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">The Long Pursuit</th><td data-label="Requirements / start window">Back Alley; Close Friend (200); after A Hunter Bleeds / The Hunter I Chose; 21:00–23:59</td><td data-label="Cost / recovery">90 min; 20 Energy; restores 5 Calm</td><td data-label="Reward / limit">once</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">No Weapon Between Us</th><td data-label="Requirements / start window">Residential Block; Crush (400); after Five Minutes of Night / The Long Pursuit; 06:00–08:59</td><td data-label="Cost / recovery">90 min; 15 Energy; restores 15 Calm</td><td data-label="Reward / limit">once</td></tr></tbody></table><p>The three conversations are The Hunter I Chose after Comic Con, Friend 100/even 10:00–13:00; The Long Pursuit after the later alley scene, Close Friend 200/21:00–24:00; then No Weapon Between Us after Five Minutes of Night, Crush 400/06:00–09:00.</p><p>The shared chain also requires Torea’s dates and conversations. Her room visit Loose the Cat needs both women at Friend 100 and their earlier conversations; later shared visits lead to Five Minutes of Night, both Close Friend 200/21:00–24:00 in the alley. The final housing-block scene needs Romantic 800 and the third Helsa conversation.</p></section>
<section id="en-activities"><h2>Activities and rewards</h2><table><thead><tr><th scope="col">Action</th><th scope="col">Requirements / start window</th><th scope="col">Cost / recovery</th><th scope="col">Reward / limit</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><th scope="row">Talk to Helsa</th><td data-label="Requirements / start window">University Hall / City Library (Uptown) / Back Alley / Residential Block; Stranger (0)</td><td data-label="Cost / recovery">20 min</td><td data-label="Reward / limit">+1 base affection; 3/day</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Comic Con Date</th><td data-label="Requirements / start window">University Hall; Friend (100); after A Student of Monsters; odd days, 09:00–12:59</td><td data-label="Cost / recovery">120 min; $120; 40 Energy; restores 5 Calm</td><td data-label="Reward / limit">once</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Stargazing Date</th><td data-label="Requirements / start window">Back Alley; Close Friend (200); after A Hunter Bleeds / The Long Pursuit; 20:00–21:59</td><td data-label="Cost / recovery">120 min; $50; 25 Energy; restores 10 Calm</td><td data-label="Reward / limit">once</td></tr></tbody></table><p>Talk gives 1 base affection in 20 min, three/day shared across locations. Tactical Awareness improves her relationship bonus; Artemis teaches that skill.</p><p>Separate venue invitations are also available at Crush 400:KTV or Night Club 20:00–23:00. Unbuffed costs are 120 min/$150/40 Energy at KTV and 120 min/$100/30 Energy at Night Club, with its supporter-access prompt. Each venue has one shared daily allowance; these do not replace her two personal dates.</p><p>Favorite stats are Intelligence, Perception, Mystic. Learning Tactical Awareness improves the relationship bonus.</p><p>Start times are shown; the ending hour is excluded. Base affection receives the relationship bonuses, while direct affection is added as listed. Ordinary affection, player Erotic Experience and NPC intimacy experience are separate.</p></section>
<section id="en-troubleshooting"><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Troubleshooting"></span><h2>What usually blocks the next step</h2><ul><li>Do not use the 20:00 patrol window for the 01:00–04:00 introduction.</li><li>Library conversations require even days, and the university date requires odd days.</li><li>If the later alley or housing-block step is absent, check Torea’s shared scenes and the preceding Helsa conversation; more affection does not replace them.</li></ul></section>
<section id="en-related"><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Related_Pages"></span><h2>Related guides</h2><ul><li><a href="character-torea.html">Torea’s connected route</a></li><li><a href="character-artemis.html">Artemis and Tactical Awareness</a></li><li><a href="game-systems-relationships-dating-and-intimacy.html">Dates and venue invitations</a></li><li><a href="game-systems-story-beats.html">Story progression</a></li></ul></section>
</div><div class="wiki-source-content wiki-source-content-zh" data-lang-panel="zh" hidden="" lang="zh-CN"><section id="zh-overview"><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Best_Automatic_Scene_Bonuses"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Automatic_Scene_Requirements"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-No_Weapon_Between_Us"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-The_Long_Pursuit"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-The_Hunter_I_Chose"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Best_Heart-to-Heart_Answers"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Heart-to-Heart_Requirements"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Dates"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Talk_and_Relationship_Rewards"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Recommended_Relationship_Walkthrough"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Unlocking_Helsa"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Quick_Stats"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Overview"></span><h2>概览</h2><figure class="reviewed-screenshot" style="max-width: 256px"><a aria-label="查看完整截图：Helsa 的角色头像。" href="../assets/images/wiki/profiles/helsa.webp" rel="noopener" target="_blank"><img alt="Helsa 的角色头像。" decoding="async" height="175" loading="lazy" src="../assets/images/wiki/profiles/helsa.webp" width="175"/></a><figcaption>Helsa 的角色头像。</figcaption></figure><p>Helsa的调查与Torea路线相连。目前有六段个人事件、两次个人约会、三段顺序交心及共同事件；背景和追猎结果留待游戏中发现。</p></section>
<section id="zh-location"><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Regular_Schedule"></span><h2>去哪里找</h2><p>先完成银之气息，再于01:00–04:00前往后巷触发追猎来临。首次事件与后来的夜间巡逻时段不同。</p><p>之后，单数日09:00–13:00在大学大厅，双数日10:00–14:00在城市图书馆（上城区），每天20:00–24:00在市中心后巷。完成猎人也会流血后，住宅街区06:00–09:00也开放。</p></section>
<section id="zh-route"><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Current_Route_Boundaries"></span><h2>路线与关系进展</h2><p>依次推进大学事件→朋友100的漫展约会→第一次图书馆交心→图书馆事件。之后衔接Torea路线，再返回进行后续巷道事件、第二次交心与观星。</p><table><thead><tr><th scope="col">自动事件</th><th scope="col">地点／开始时段</th><th scope="col">条件</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><th scope="row">追猎来临</th><td data-label="地点／开始时段">后巷；01:00–03:59</td><td data-label="条件">完成：银之气息</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">怪物的研究者</th><td data-label="地点／开始时段">大学大厅；单数日，09:00–12:59</td><td data-label="条件">已遇见（10好感）；完成：追猎来临</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Helsa的图书馆事件</th><td data-label="地点／开始时段">城市图书馆（上城区）；双数日，10:00–13:59</td><td data-label="条件">朋友（100好感）；完成：和Helsa逛动漫展、我所选择的猎人</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">猎人也会流血</th><td data-label="地点／开始时段">后巷；21:00–23:59</td><td data-label="条件">完成：放出那只猫</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">她没有射出的那支箭</th><td data-label="地点／开始时段">后巷；21:00–23:59</td><td data-label="条件">亲密朋友（200好感）；完成：和Helsa一起观星、缎带系着獠牙、漫长的追猎</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">归来的猎人</th><td data-label="地点／开始时段">住宅街区；06:00–08:59</td><td data-label="条件">浪漫感（800好感）；完成：夜晚的五分钟、我们之间没有武器</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">放出那只猫</th><td data-label="地点／开始时段">Torea的房间；19:00–21:59</td><td data-label="条件">Torea 朋友（100好感）；朋友（100好感）；完成：与 Torea 的嘉年华约会、Helsa的图书馆事件、饥渴的形状、我所选择的猎人</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">血债与血之选择</th><td data-label="地点／开始时段">Torea的房间；19:00–21:59</td><td data-label="条件">Torea 亲密朋友（200好感）；完成：日落后的木板路、猎人也会流血、更广阔的夜；Becky当前可用</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">夜晚的五分钟</th><td data-label="地点／开始时段">后巷；21:00–23:59</td><td data-label="条件">Torea 亲密朋友（200好感）；亲密朋友（200好感）；完成：血债与血之选择、她没有射出的那支箭、更广阔的夜、漫长的追猎</td></tr></tbody></table><table><thead><tr><th scope="col">行动</th><th scope="col">条件／开始时段</th><th scope="col">消耗／恢复</th><th scope="col">奖励／次数</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><th scope="row">我所选择的猎人</th><td data-label="条件／开始时段">城市图书馆（上城区）；朋友（100好感）；完成：和Helsa逛动漫展；双数日，10:00–12:59</td><td data-label="消耗／恢复">75分钟；15精力；恢复5镇定</td><td data-label="奖励／次数">仅一次</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">漫长的追猎</th><td data-label="条件／开始时段">后巷；亲密朋友（200好感）；完成：猎人也会流血、我所选择的猎人；21:00–23:59</td><td data-label="消耗／恢复">90分钟；20精力；恢复5镇定</td><td data-label="奖励／次数">仅一次</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">我们之间没有武器</th><td data-label="条件／开始时段">住宅街区；迷恋（400好感）；完成：夜晚的五分钟、漫长的追猎；06:00–08:59</td><td data-label="消耗／恢复">90分钟；15精力；恢复15镇定</td><td data-label="奖励／次数">仅一次</td></tr></tbody></table><p>三次交心分别为：漫展后，朋友100、双数日10:00–13:00的我所选择的猎人；后续巷道事件后，亲密朋友200、21:00–24:00的漫长的追猎；以及夜晚的五分钟后，迷恋400、06:00–09:00的我们之间没有武器。</p><p>共同路线另需Torea的约会与交心。她房间中的放出那只猫要求两人均为朋友100，并完成各自前面的交心；后续共同事件通向两人均为亲密朋友200、后巷21:00–24:00的夜间事件。最后的住宅区事件要求浪漫感800及第三次Helsa交心。</p></section>
<section id="zh-activities"><h2>行动与奖励</h2><table><thead><tr><th scope="col">行动</th><th scope="col">条件／开始时段</th><th scope="col">消耗／恢复</th><th scope="col">奖励／次数</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><th scope="row">和Helsa交谈</th><td data-label="条件／开始时段">大学大厅 / 城市图书馆（上城区） / 后巷 / 住宅街区；陌生人（0好感）</td><td data-label="消耗／恢复">20分钟</td><td data-label="奖励／次数">基础好感+1；每天3次</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">动漫展约会</th><td data-label="条件／开始时段">大学大厅；朋友（100好感）；完成：怪物的研究者；单数日，09:00–12:59</td><td data-label="消耗／恢复">120分钟；$120；40精力；恢复5镇定</td><td data-label="奖励／次数">仅一次</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">观星约会</th><td data-label="条件／开始时段">后巷；亲密朋友（200好感）；完成：猎人也会流血、漫长的追猎；20:00–21:59</td><td data-label="消耗／恢复">120分钟；$50；25精力；恢复10镇定</td><td data-label="奖励／次数">仅一次</td></tr></tbody></table><p>交谈20分钟、1基础好感，各地点共用每天三次。战术意识可提高她的关系加成，该技能由Artemis教授。</p><p>迷恋400还可参加独立场所邀请：KTV或夜店20:00–23:00。未计药剂时，KTV为120分钟、$150、40精力；夜店为120分钟、$100、30精力，另需其赞助者权限。每个场所共用每天一次额度，不能替代两次个人约会。</p><p>偏好的属性为智力、感知、神秘。学会战术意识可提高关系加成。</p><p>表中均为开始时间，不包含结束整点。基础好感受关系加成影响，直接好感按所列数值增加。普通好感、玩家情趣经验和NPC亲密经验分别计算。</p></section>
<section id="zh-troubleshooting"><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Troubleshooting"></span><h2>卡住时检查什么</h2><ul><li>首次事件要在01:00–04:00前往，不能用后来的20:00巡逻时段代替。</li><li>图书馆交心要求双数日，大学漫展约会要求单数日。</li><li>后续巷道或住宅区环节不出现时，检查Torea共同事件与上一段Helsa交心；提高好感不能替代前置。</li></ul></section>
